# Crawlora {{DISPLAY_NAME}} Rust SDK

[![Crates.io](https://img.shields.io/crates/v/{{RUST_CRATE_NAME}}.svg)](https://crates.io/crates/{{RUST_CRATE_NAME}})
[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blue.svg)](LICENSE)

Official async Rust client for Crawlora's hosted {{DISPLAY_NAME}} API. It exposes
typed request parameters and response handling for {{OPERATION_COUNT}} public
operations. It calls Crawlora's hosted service; it does not scrape {{DISPLAY_NAME}}
locally. Requests use your Crawlora account and follow its billing plan. Crawlora
is independent from and not affiliated with or endorsed by {{DISPLAY_NAME}} or
its owners.

