## Install

```sh
cargo add {{RUST_CRATE_NAME}}
```

To pin a release directly in `Cargo.toml`:

```toml
[dependencies]
{{RUST_CRATE_NAME}} = "{{VERSION}}"
```

Create an account at [crawlora.net](https://crawlora.net/signup?utm_source=crates.io&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=platform-clients&utm_content={{PLATFORM}}-rust-signup), then [create an API key](https://crawlora.net/app/api-keys?utm_source=crates.io&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=platform-clients&utm_content={{PLATFORM}}-rust-api-keys). Keep the key out of source control and load it from the environment:

```sh
export CRAWLORA_API_KEY="your-crawlora-api-key"
```

## Quick start

```rust,no_run
